{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29635","headline":"赠从兄阆之 · 李商隐","name":"赠从兄阆之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怅望人间万事违，私书幽梦约忘机。\n荻花村里鱼标在，石藓庭中鹿迹微。\n幽径定携僧共入，寒塘好与月相依。\n城中猘犬憎兰佩，莫损幽芳久不归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}